  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Fondo Nacional de Medio Ambiente II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Environment Fund II Stage</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROJECT WILL SUPPORT THE NATIONAL ENVIRONMENT FUND, VIA AN INVESTMENT COMPONENT AND AN INSTITUT. STRENGTH. COMPONENT. THE OBJECTIVES OF THE FUND ARE TO PROMOTE: (1) THE CONSERVATION AND SUSTAINABLE USE OF NATURAL RESOURCES AND IMPROVE ENVIRON. QUALITY IN BR; AND (2) THE PARTICIPATION OF CIVIL SOCIETY IN THE SOLUTION ON ENVIRON. PROBLEMS AT THE LOCAL LEVEL. THE FUND PROVIDES GRANTS FOR SMALL PROJECTS EXECUTED BY NGOS, MUNICIPALITIES, UNIV., STATE AND FED. AUTHO.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
